Aesthetics bundles are used to let the player change their aesthetics when diverging their culture.

== Structure ==
key = {
	name_list = key # Can be repeated. At least one is required
	building_gfx = { key key key } # Required; each key must have loc
	clothing_gfx/unit_gfx/coa_gfx # Same as building_gfx

	# Whether it'll be shown when diverging
	# root is the diverging character's culture, scope:character is the character
	is_shown = {}
}

The loc key <key>_name must exist.
